# audio never goes in git (the library lives on Drive; only audio/manifest.jsonl is kept here)
*.wav
*.m4a
*.mp3
# ...except the one quiet sound bed under "Write your own night" (made in code with ffmpeg, our own, 27 Nov 2026).
# The exception lives HERE, not in app/assets/audio/.gitignore: eas-cli copies the project for a store build with its
# own ignore rules, where a parent's *.mp3 beats a child folder's exception (app/test/storeArchive.unit.ts).
!app/assets/audio/night-bed.mp3
*.opus
__pycache__/

